 技能）\n目标：让“自主智能式工作”感觉像一个产品，而不是一个终端。","tags":["opencode","人工智能","大语言模型","智能体","自主智能"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://openwork.software/","releaseDate":"2026-02-04","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/different-ai/openwork/releases/tag/v0.11.10","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.10/DifferentAI.OpenWork.yaml","sha256":"ba6b753aaf88b27ecc58bbdeeef1ff3bc6e5de07af9b767910f36b10e39e0143"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.10/DifferentAI.OpenWork.installer.yaml","sha256":"1bbb70a5f8c1a2d020e8dd20a3e484b04fe09ef6f6e7cb10950cda163eff92f1"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.10/DifferentAI.OpenWork.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"47a156d11de827faa848949f41fe6606ac0dc165057b0d55c618b45aac6942b5"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.10/DifferentAI.OpenWork.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"9aa19a1ccaac61bf1b883dc9fd818fff506015b7e839dd5ab85a2e96c07cd438"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"0.11.10"}